## 2. Functional Alignment — Tier DAG

Tier1 Governance: openOODA correct (13 boards, SHIPPED). Research duplicated (research vs openOODA/rfcs same STE100).
Tier2 Engine: ooda correct colocation (compiler+std+qa) per CONSTRAINTS.oot 1.5 two-repo split. Mixing intentional for Merkle K_manifest=H(relpath). Splitting std would duplicate Hash(std) and break eta 0.998.
Tier2 QA: ooda/qa domain cert (33 parents) correct. qa external challenger naming collision (qa vs ooda/qa) — 4 test roots (tests/, qa/tests, ooda/tests, ooda/qa).
Tier3 Portal: openOODA.github.io correct. Duplicates ooda/dist tarballs (21M) and registry.html.
Tier3 Registry: provenance isolation (Ed25519) argues separate, but 50k dummy ooda_aero_* fixtures mimic bench, not packages.
Tier3 Brand: only portal consumes logos — should merge to openOODA.github.io/brand.
Tier3 Install: split across ooda/install, github.io/install.sh, cli/cmd_install — dead install repo.

Score: ooda 9/10, openOODA 8/10, github.io 8/10, helloworld 9/10, registry 6/10, brand 5/10, research 5/10, qa 6/10, vscode/tree-sitter 5/10, install 2/10.

