Hub1 Canonical EBNF ooda/ooda.ebnf 112 lines — dictates parser/LSP/highlighter. Drift breaks SSoT.
Hub2 Capability Checker oodac/check_caps.oo + runtime/chs_rt_caps.c + SECURITY.oot 14 tokens — zero ambient authority.
Hub3 Emitter oodac/x86_ssa_compile.oo + c_emit* 88 files + c_avx/c_neon — direct ELF >100k lines/s, Merkle K.
Hub4 Enforcer openOODA/scripts/enforcer.oo + verify_all.oo + check_board.oo — 8 Gates, single command.
Fix hubs before tail. 4754 std files are commodity if hubs hold.

